From 92ed37f33daf68e80b514b1a73f5d28eb5b31e5f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 5 Jul 2026 15:53:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix regenerative-delay crashes, reward-scale bug, and stale
 plot/eval wiring

- Fix dt/n_substeps defaults in test_env_checker.py, test.py, and
  check_plate_random_policy_new.py that violated the plant's regenerative-delay
  invariant, crashing on high-rpm random actions by default.
- Fix dead validation checks in validate_stochastic_setup.py (info["y0"] ->
  info["y_cutter"], ac_action_cost -> ap_action_cost) left over from the ac->ap
  rename.
- Fix compute_stability_lobe.py pass-completion check to match the plant's
  actual termination_reason strings.
- Fix eager np.trapz reference in compute_nonlinear_stiffness_updated.py that
  crashed on NumPy versions without the legacy alias.
- Fix stale clamped-side/path-direction metadata in eval/pipeline.py.
- Unify ap_max default (10mm -> 18mm) between PlatePlant and registration.
- Rebalance DenseProductivePlateReward (productivity_weight, omega_cost_weight,
  w_weight) after numerically verifying the previous weights made dense
  per-step reward negative even at a safe, non-chattering operating point.
- Remove confirmed-dead/superseded files: run_nl_last_time.py,
  compute_natural_frequencies_prim.py, check_plate_random_policy.py.
- Fix y0/pass_completed field bugs and ac->ap mislabeling in
  plot_paper_figures.py; add force-signal capture to eval_policy.py; add
  reward-decomposition, cutting-force, and pass-line-robustness figures.
- Update README.md to match current module layout, action naming, and tools.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EG6sRKnSk6bBaJQGfg3ata
